worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_11.js"
  ceiling 1205
  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling moved 1198 to 1205 with issue #1175: formalizeSoftwareProjectRequest now routes through detectSoftwareObjectPhrase (the head-noun guard twin) instead of the any-position artifact scan, mirroring SoftwareProjectMeaning::from_prompt in src/solver_handlers/software_project.rs."
